# ALLIANCE. New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/blackmaw-hold and quest pages (level range is Blizzard's).
@dungeon Blackmaw Hold
@levels 55-60
@window 53-60
@best 56
@hub Azshara, 12.0, 77.0, 12
@hub Winterspring, 61.0, 38.0, 8
@hub Felwood, 62.0, 24.0, 8
@hub Stormwind City, 50.0, 50.0
@hub Ironforge, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is a furbolg city behind the big gate in Azshara; Commander Truesong says the way in is a burrow north of Talrendis Point that furbolgs and satyrs fight over. Commander Truesong at Talrendis Point (Azshara 11.9, 78.2) gives Beneath Nordrassil, which sends you to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus (35.4, 8.4) for Get to the Roots of It. Ogtinc (Azshara 42.4, 42.6) gives Claws That Rend, Tusks that Gore. Ekkal at the Ruins of Eldarath (Azshara 42.0, 38.9) gives Blackmaw Pouches. Archmage Timear in Dalaran (Alterac Mountains 16.2, 71.7) gives Blackmaw Magic. The Twin Bears goes to Lorekeeper Nok at Ursolan; his exact spot is not known. Take what is offered: the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
